    "en": {
      "trackName": "Arkanode",
      "description": "A fast, clean, old-school brick breaker — rebuilt for today.\nTake on a growing stack of handcrafted layouts, tricky shapes, and multi-ball chaos. Tap to launch, keep the ball alive, and clear every brick to move forward.\n\nEach level brings a different pattern: spirals, walls, tunnels, zig-zags, tight corridors, and a few surprises. The pace ramps up, balls get faster, and precision matters more the further you go.\n\nFeatures\n\nSmooth and responsive controls\n\nMulti-ball power-ups and escalating speed\n\nOver 100 layout patterns that mix and rotate as you progress\n\nClean retro visuals\n\nQuick restarts and short, satisfying rounds\n\nOptional sound effects and haptics\n\nNo accounts. No timers. Just pure brick-breaking.\n\nPerfect for quick sessions or long streaks.\nHow far can you get?",
      "releaseNotes": "Added new levels and high scores. Changed name",
